        "accession_number": "0001872789-25-000036",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In connection with our separation from Becton, Dickinson and Company (\"BD\") in 2022 (the “Separation”), we entered into a cannula supply agreement with BD, whereby BD sells to us cannulas for incorporation into our pen needles and syringes.",
